# Misc
.env
# Everything under .claude is local, except the skills — those are instructions
# for working on this repo and are no use to anyone if they only exist on one
# machine. The contents are excluded rather than the folder itself, because git
# does not look inside an excluded folder and the exception would never be read.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
test videos/
Trained Models/
dataset/
test/
